        "TileImage": "$($repository 3ee70c86-8407-44bd-9927-3002d265a3a2).Image",
        "Description": "Good Afternoon 47\r\rYour targets today are Ghislaine Maxwell and Jeffery Epstein ex Mossad agents involved in the sexual trafficing and exploitation of countless minors. Their operation was a Mossad blackmail operation implicating countless high ranking elites. They are now in Thornbridge Manor undercover. To the public eye however Jefferey has killed himself and Ghislaine is pending trail. Our client is trying to end any connection to the Mossad these two have.\r\rGood hunting 47",
